      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8088/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together cake mix, butter, 2 eggs, and 1 teaspoon vanilla in a large bowl until well-combined. Pat mixture into a 9x13-inch dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XHa50YcaFDS19Ifdu52MsU_Lmt8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8088-gooey-butter-cake-step3-3x4-0135064414801627-fb9f4f46205745f3835265af139b5507.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8088/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cream cheese, remaining 2 eggs, and remaining 1 teaspoon vanilla with an electric mixer in a bowl. Slowly beat in confectioner's sugar. Pour over cake layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uX5lo-k8INoErzcQb6bJL7l1VXU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8088-gooey-butter-cake-step6-3x4-0135064414801632-ecb357708f1745d58b0170721f7cafaf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8088/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 35 to 40 minutes. Cool before serving. Enjoy!",
